		(property "Description" "Adafruit INA228 I2C 85V 20-bit power monitor breakout (PID 5832), represented as its JP2 1x8 0.1in header: pin order VCC,GND,SCL,SDA,VBUS,VIN-,VIN+,ALRT, verified against Adafruit's published Eagle source (github.com/adafruit/Adafruit-INA228-PCB). Mates with the Library:INA228_Breakout_Socket footprint for direct pin-socket stacking, no wiring."
